# Project Prism has NO root-level .env — configuration lives in the two
# sub-projects. This file is a signpost only; do not create a root .env.
#
#   Backend  → copy functions/.env.example → functions/.env
#              (LLM provider/keys/tuning, BigQuery source)
#
#   Frontend → copy hosting/.env.example  → hosting/.env
#              (VITE_FIREBASE_* client config)
#
# In production the backend LLM keys come from Firebase Secret Manager, not a
# .env file. See CLAUDE.md → Environment Variables and ONBOARDING.md → Quick start.
